What’s Trending in Difference-in-Differences?
A Synthesis of the Recent Econometrics LiteratureThanks: We thank Brant Callaway, Bruno Ferman, Andreas Hagemann, Kevin Lang, David McKenzie, and David Schönholzer for helpful comments, and Scott Barkowski for suggesting the title.
Jonathan Roth
††thanks: Brown University. jonathanroth@brown.eduPedro H. C. Sant’Anna
††thanks: Microsoft and Vanderbilt University. pedro.h.santanna@vanderbilt.eduAlyssa Bilinski
