- Four new DEFT workflows in the TAO Skill Bank: object detection, which stages mined data in the Open Vocabulary Object Detection/Segmentation (ODVG) format for Grounding DINO; People Attribute Search; automated optical inspection (AOI) on Cosmos-Reason 3; and Cosmos-Reason mining for Intelligent Transportation Systems. The existing AOI and AutoML DEFT pipeline workflows are substantially revised.
...
- Object-detection gap analysis: a new `object_detection` subtask in the Data Services `gap_analysis` command. It compares object-detection predictions against ground truth from KITTI or COCO annotations and writes per-box gaps, per-image and per-class metrics, a weak-image set, and a summary report.
- Documented ``gap_analysis``: the full `gap_analysis` command is documented for the first time, covering the `object_detection`, `vcn_aoi`, and `vlm_bcq` subtasks.
