 Shall we take a closer look? 

 The condenser transforms warm and moist air from damp laundry to dry air. When moist air passes through the condenser, tiny dust can stick to the condenser. So we made our dryers to wash the condenser every time you run dry cycles. If you want to clean the condenser separately, use [Condenser Care] function of the dryer. 

 

 Wait! Here are some more tips You can remove the dust more effectively by running [Condenser Care] after [Air Dry] cycle.

