1. Company Information
Edelweiss Financial Services Limited , incorporated in 1995, is a leading diversified Indian financial services conglomerate headquartered in Mumbai. It operates across multiple segments including investment banking, retail and corporate credit, asset management, insurance (life and general), asset reconstruction, and alternative asset management. The company serves corporations, institutions, and individuals with products such as SME loans, home loans, mutual funds, and alternative investment funds. As the investor manager of Edelweiss Multi Strategy Investment Trust, it focuses on dynamic multi-strategy asset allocation. With a broad client base and over 10,000 employees, Edelweiss continues to grow as a comprehensive financial solutions provider in India.
Company Insight
• Edelweiss Financial Services Limited (“EFSL”), was incorporated on November 21, 1995 under the name Edelweiss Capital Limited and started operations as an investment banking firm after receipt of a Category II license from SEBI. The name of Edelweiss Capital Limited was changed to ‘Edelweiss Financial Services Limited’ with effect from August 1, 2011.
