when a large inventory of vaccines shall be stored in the refrigerator (e.g., 
influenza season) without crowding; 
viii)Be maintained at temperatures between +2°C and +8°C.The thermostat 
should be set at midrange to achieve a temperature of about +5°C, which will 
decrease the likelihood of temperature excursions;5 

