The circumpolar region has large natural reserves in the bowels. To develop these reserves, the company AGD “DIAMONDS JSC” uses a BelAZ 75131 mining dump truck, but at the same time difficulties arise due to the influence of low negative temperatures on the performance of the equipment. We conducted an analysis, identified the main features of the operation of the dump truck, identified the factors that affect simple machinery, made recommendations on reducing failures associated with the destruction of metal structures, on preparing the engine, undercarriage and brake systems, on equipping the production base, on labor protection and life safety when working on the BelAZ 75131 mining dump truck at low negative temperatures in order to minimize the failures of equipment operating in the Far North.

