## Designed For Control

 Our oil-cooled, four corner, multiple disc braking system delivers reliable performance and superior control in the most extreme haul road conditions. Cat trucks achieve better control by enabling immediate, fade-resistant braking and retarding, and by using the full weight of the truck for traction. 

## Improved Powertrain

 The mechanical drive powertrain and power shift transmission provide unmatched efficiency and control on steep grades, in poor underfoot conditions and on haul roads with high rolling resistance. Multiple emissions packages and application-specific capabilities help you build a Cat truck to meet your site-specific needs.

