Minimum Requirements
SteadyMouse 2 is optimized and elegant under the hood, so that it will run seamlessly on the majority of computers out there with no issues.
Fully compatible with the following OS versions:
Windows 11 (x86, x64, ARM64)
Windows 10
Windows 8.1
Windows 8
Windows 7
Windows Vista
Windows XP (SP3)
Windows Server 2016
Windows Server 2012
User privileges:
Admin rights are necessary just to install or upgrade.
Basic user rights are all that is needed to run SteadyMouse.
Mouse hardware:
All known types of mice are supported
You can find a list of tested mouse types here
Future Support (Not ready yet):
Apple MacOS (and potentially Linux) support is NOT YET available however work is in progress.
You may sign up here to be notified when it is ready.
ETA is unknown as this work is extremely difficult.
If you purchased "SteadyMouse X (All Versions)", you will have access to it when ready.
