1.4 Research Questions

This raises the central research question of this dissertation: How can the Digiball be made more
accessible and versatile through its software? To address this, the proposed approach integrates
traditional gesture learning algorithms into the Digiball’s web-based application. Researchers have

demonstrated that adaptive systems based on user-defined input profiles can respond to individual

user behavior. This adaptability allows for flexible mappings, even when users generate noisy or

non-standard input patterns [12, 8].

