This dataset provides updated national scores for Hofstede’s six cultural dimensions across 119 countries. The scores reflect cultural values including:
* Power Distance (PDI): Acceptance of hierarchical order and authority
* Individualism (IDV): Degree of interdependence among members of society
* Masculinity (MAS): Preference for achievement, heroism, assertiveness
* Uncertainty Avoidance (UAI): Society’s tolerance for ambiguity
* Long-Term Orientation (LTO): Focus on future rewards over short-term benefits
* Indulgence (IVR): Degree to which people try to control their desires and impulses
